{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3041d0e19647208eebfd04de58ab4fc551b0694b03918e5d1de58b6b2df0b260", "ja": "ちょっとした行き違いから、気まずい状態に\n陥ってしまったプロデューサーと風花。定期\n公演も間近に迫る中、すれ違うふたりを見か\nねたメンバー達は一計を案じる。やがて誤解\nが解け、最高のステージが幕を開けた。", "zh": "因为一点小小的误会，制作人与风花\n陷入了尴尬的局面。定期公演迫在眉睫，\n成员们不忍看着两人渐行渐远，心生一计。\n不久后误会解开，最棒的舞台拉开了帷幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1000_p", "source_sha256": "433d9aeaf5e0c43b216379691be7463e6bc4b088df7daddb779427ebaa45c130", "ja": "（無事、公演が終わった。風花の表現力が、\nまた一段階上がった気がするステージだったな……！）", "zh": "（公演顺利结束了。感觉风花的表现力又提升了一个层次，真是一场精彩的演出啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "261ff1db085ad38ac04531885ec100d2a932b6a9b88916866ab768cfd104d44d", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nあ、あの……どうでしたか？　私のステージ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n那、那个……您觉得怎么样？我的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1002_p", "source_sha256": "18397037d42db91742eae8365674e78d89aba9435225cd6ee7cd25e68b808fe0", "ja": "お疲れ様、風花。もちろん、最高だったぞ！\n風花の歌の世界が、また広がったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，风花。当然棒极了！\n风花歌声中的世界又扩展开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c4ee865d2f67995c013e9c1a09481331e0fe124b4ae9eb72ac739d82dc8452b6", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？　良かった……。\n私なりに、気持ちをこめて歌ったつもりですけど……。", "zh": "真、真的吗？那太好了……\n我也倾注了自己的感情去唱，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "68853d8d0f7ef156a92789ca0cf49d97cee5483699aed6b6a07871d05020cfda", "ja": "ステージを見てくれた人たちにも、\nちゃんと届いてたらいいな……なんて。", "zh": "要是也能好好传达给观看舞台的大家就好了……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "c3ef2ecd2822d2474238e12b9564d5bc2e7b78b9783892219fe2c9f853c04217", "ja": "それなら、心配いらないと思うわ。\n私たちにも、たくさん伝わってきたから……。", "zh": "既然这样，我想不用担心了。\n因为我们也切切实实感受到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "6a8e01a3dffb76eaf9d4a22679f902f880a8b0f74df209a58dcdfd65f97cbe39", "ja": "うんうん！　私も、風花さんの歌から\nとっても大きなメッセージを感じましたよ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！我也从风花小姐的歌声中感受到了非常强烈的信息哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "efec727e718ea3c80ff2452fa01326b0a1727e19ec273ddefab02cff7279ed91", "ja": "「アイドルが楽しい！」って！", "zh": "那就是“做偶像真开心！”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "ea4d25137c8028b654eeaa0a0076666cb7711cd8b0672a288db98d328f132637", "ja": "そうですね。{$P$}と風花さんが\nすれ違った時は、どうしようかと思いましたけど。", "zh": "是啊。看到{$P$}和风花小姐擦肩而过时，我还真不知道该怎么办才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f65886badd8e1defaeb547617a7d063b7e71347c0d845ed1e600bafa6b476aa7", "ja": "うっ。", "zh": "呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "4eb320ed0ab475ef5205432b7c7b8b85628404c86a2b330603deb42d44b635a0", "ja": "でも、ちゃんと仲直りできてよかったのです。\n公演も無事に終わって、のーぷろぶれむ！なのです♪", "zh": "不过，能好好和好真是太好了。\n演出也顺利结束了，完全没问题！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "018283759de63bbb26bf5028efef3a2f8b61d267a4421df6d24e3421b0565ce8", "ja": "とはいえ、こんな事が頻繁だと困りますからね。\nふたりとも、ちゃんと反省してくださいね？", "zh": "话虽如此，这种事要是经常发生也会很困扰的。\n你们两个，都要好好反省哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1012_p", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "6e531a9ef8d79c37d8e505165158e0a066e1f4f63b29798bbdcc104e1dc6ed07", "ja": "まあまあ、律子ちゃん。\n続きは、着替えてからにしましょう。", "zh": "好了好了，律子。\n换好衣服之后再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "afbde459194ca1074341c2c31d940012a0b1925f5347cd8a0a820fe0b3d7e3a8", "ja": "そういえば、衣装のままでしたね。\n続きは後にしましょうか！", "zh": "说起来，我们还穿着演出服呢。之后再继续吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c5a2aa86a2db2b97d64a1c6f83a2110ed9b65f500b0a660b3ebedc6989d14a16", "ja": "……あれ？　行かないのか、風花。", "zh": "……咦？不走吗，风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ebb5f34d7b7dc46afe427308319b99afbab65ef4311ce67b15dafaa9c0eafa78", "ja": "あの……私、{$P$}さんに\n言い忘れたことがあって……。", "zh": "那个……我有件事忘了告诉{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "95ce521bd611f0b56ffd26f1d2bd210d8d2b42b82111be9705de0d715b0c8dfa", "ja": "今回の新曲を聞いた時、すごくうれしかったんです。\nなのに、伝える機会を逃しちゃったから……。", "zh": "听到这次的新歌时，我真的特别开心。\n可是错过了告诉您的机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b3aec021dc6233c90a4291b9508bab03027e55c4416b030a11e8e1bd66418b2d", "ja": "素敵な曲で、本当にうれしかったです。\nありがとうございました！", "zh": "真是一首美妙的歌，我真的特别开心。\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1020_p", "source_sha256": "258bde34b056bf34de36d57cf28fea2aa0be792d1edd319361a9f3e6e0a23ae9", "ja": "風花……。", "zh": "风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bfe91fd035c9574cc90d87a6b10cb9369d42ce728af4a6d57d313edf3dc83c66", "ja": "私も、着替えてきますね！", "zh": "我也去换衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1022_p", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4d450179c5b534066e00cee9a4b17169d1306e0876e489489ef25afb7f42e5a5", "ja": "（思いは言葉にしないと届かない。身近な相手ほど、\n言葉にしなくても伝わると思うのは甘えだな……）", "zh": "（心意不说出来就无法传达给对方。越是亲近的人，越觉得即使不说也能明白，这种想法未免太天真了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_092_1024_p", "source_sha256": "178da02f0d7d5377eed1a7d95d591cb98c9eb54556e62f4be87b8c97ab504f2c", "ja": "（これからも、どんどん言葉にしていこう。\nそれが、風花の輝きに繋がるなら……！）", "zh": "（今后也要不断把想法说出来。\n如果这样能成为风花绽放光芒的助力的话……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
